Description: DAQ frontend interface for devices running plumCore
 da_UI is the frontend interface of data acquisition devices running the
 plumCore framework, connected over BLE, serial, SWD, SSH or UDP.
 .
 The pyqtgraph plotting library, the SimplePyBLE Bluetooth library and the
 pynbus2 client library are bundled. The serial, SWD and SSH connections need
 the recommended packages.
